{
 "about": "EET fields (FinDatEx EET V1.1.3, data/reference/eet/eet_fields.json) that state what a product's SFDR pre-contractual template (Annex II for Art. 8, Annex III for Art. 9 of Delegated Regulation 2022/1288, family sfdr_product) already answers. Such a field is read from the template answer (fund_sfdr_answers), never typed a second time: 'percent' is the tick-box's printed share, 'ticked' its box (Y / N), 'values' the sum of the chart's own categories. A proportion is written as a decimal (0.5 = 50 %). Declared reading (Tellumen): 20440 for an Art. 8 product is the sum of its Taxonomy-aligned and other environmental categories (Annex II prints no single 'environmental' box). Every item and label id must exist in the governing template (tests/unit/test_eet_sfdr_items.py).",
